  "description": "The LoadBearing spec contract: a fluent C# builder and reified rule model for describing .NET architecture — layers, scopes, and rules, each with a posture (Enforce for the law, Migrate for ratcheted debt with a grandfathered baseline, Quarantine for code contained rather than touched). Architecture spec projects reference this package; checking and rendering come from the loadbearing tool (Zphil.LoadBearing.Cli) or the xUnit adapter (Zphil.LoadBearing.Xunit). netstandard2.0 with zero dependencies, so a spec project can target anything from net48 up.",
